      "content": "that sounds nice on paper but it doesn't feel real. life isn't about \"unique perspectives\" when you have no utility. the world runs on efficiency and i am a massive inefficiency. i see the way people look at me, or rather, how they don't even look at me at all. i'm just a drain on resources at this point. i'm just taking up space that could be used for something that actually matters.",
